    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid insurance certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A valid insurance certificate is crucial for the transportation process. This document covers any potential damage or accidents that might occur during the journey.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-approved consignment bill of lading:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">An IBA (Indian Bureau of Railways) approved consignment bill of lading is required for car transportation. This document serves as a contract between you, the owner of the vehicle, and the carrier company.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>To ensure complete protection for your car during transport, opt for a <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. This coverage ensures that in case of any damage or accident during transportation, you will receive compensation based on the declared value of your car.</p>
	<p>The insurance policy covers both the exterior and interior of the vehicle, as well as any personal belongings inside the car. It also protects against unforeseen events such as theft, fire, or collision during the transportation process.</p>
	<p>While the IBA-approved consignment bill of lading provides legal protection, the marine transit insurance offers an extra layer of security for your car. Make sure to thoroughly review the terms and conditions of the insurance policy before signing up to understand its coverage limits and exclusions.</p>

	<p>While the aforementioned documents are essential, there may be some additional documents required for your car transportation.</p>
